senses.gloss:
śiṣyā (see s.v. śiṣyate) = śikṣā:
(1) phonetics: vyākaraṇe nirukte śiṣyāyāṃ (all mss.; Weller 〔41 line 1〕 would read śikṣ˚) LV 〔156.19〕 (prose);
(2) śiṣyāpada = śikṣāpada: pañca-˚pada-samādattā, devoted to the five commandments, said of Māyā, LV 〔71.14〕 (prose; all mss.; not noted by Weller).
